    thinking: "**Reviewing Design and Requirements**\n\nI\'m pleased to report that the `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` steps both completed successfully, yielding no warnings or errors! Now, I\'m shifting my focus to revisiting the design and functional requirements. I\'m taking another look at the Modern Minimalist theme with a luxury tactile focus, specifically the warm parchment cream color palette.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have built **The Pet Physio Vet** application matching the design specification:\n\n- **Visual Identity & Aesthetics**: Crafted using a luxury, warm neutral palette (`#fef9f2`, `#f8f3ed`, and `#3C2117`), Plus Jakarta Sans display typography, Inter body copy, and soft structural containers.\n- **Interactive Navigation & Hero**: Features a sticky top navigation bar with active section tracking, a hero section with high-key photography, and a quick 30-second Pet Mobility Self-Checker trigger.\n- **Conditions We Treat**: Filterable condition showcase covering Arthritis, IVDD, Hip Dysplasia, Post-Surgical Rehab, Neurological Recovery, Sports Injury, Senior Mobility, and Obesity Rehab. Clicking any card opens a detailed clinical protocol modal.\n- **Healing Journey Roadmap**: An interactive 5-stage visual roadmap detailing Assessment, Diagnosis, Personalized Therapy, Progress Tracking, and Recovery.\n- **Treatment Modalities**: Modular grid showcasing Hydrotherapy, Class IV Laser, Manual Therapy, Physiotherapy, Therapeutic Exercise, and Home Programs with modal deep-dives.\n- **Patient Success Stories**: Case studies and testimonials highlighting recoveries like Bella (Post-TPLO) and Max (IVDD).\n- **Specialists Profiles**: Biographies, credentials, and consult request buttons for Dr. Sarah Jenkins, Dr. Mark Roberts, and Emma Davies.\n- **Interactive Clinic Gallery & Lightbox**: Masonry layout gallery highlighting reception, hydrotherapy suites, and private therapy bays with full-screen lightbox image viewing.\n- **Searchable FAQ & Appointment System**: Accordion FAQ list with live search, alongside an appointment request form featuring live validation, specialist selection, and confirmation reference IDs."
