  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Project Status**\n\nI\'m pleased to report the build was successful, and the linter reported no errors! I\'ve been refining the navbar specifically. I successfully addressed the \"The Pet Physio Vet\" brand title wrapping issue using `shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap`, ensuring it remains on a single line. I\'ve also adjusted header flex constraints to improve the layout.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have thoroughly checked the application and applied design and layout refinements across all screen sizes:\n\n- **Navbar Screen Optimization**:\n  - Enforced single-line logo rendering (`The Pet Physio Vet`) with `shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap` to eliminate awkward wrapping on tablet and smaller laptop viewports.\n  - Rebalanced navigation link spacing (`gap-3 xl:gap-6`) and typography so all 8 section links, the Mobility Checker CTA, and the Booking action align gracefully on screens from 320px up to 4K displays.\n  - Updated the mobile drawer menu with native Lucide icons (`ChevronRight`) for consistent rendering.\n\n- **Services & Modality Icons**:\n  - Replaced font-dependent icons in the Services section with custom-styled Lucide vector icons (`Waves`, `Zap`, `Hand`, `Dumbbell`, `Activity`, `Home`).\n\n- **Data & Typography Cleanups**:\n  - Corrected a typo in the FAQ section (\"\350\276\246Absolutely!\" \342\206\222 \"Absolutely!\").\n  - Verified touch targets, button cursor states, image aspect ratios, and modal overlay animations across mobile, tablet, and desktop viewports."
